Patents and trademarks
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

DTS Coherent Acoustics was patented by DTS, Inc. This licence grants no
rights under any patent, and the authors make no claim about whether a
licence is needed for any use. "DTS" is a trademark of its owner, used only
to name the format. The lossless extension (XLL) and the low bit-rate
extension (LBR) are not implemented: a DTS-HD Master Audio stream decodes as
its lossy core and extensions.

